{%- comment -%}
  PDP — Sticky ATC resting area (mobile).

  The mobile add-to-cart band is fixed to the bottom of the viewport and has to
  stand down before it covers full-bleed imagery. It used to key off whichever
  of Foreign Engineering or Complete the Look it found first, which meant the
  handover point moved whenever those sections were reordered.

  This section is that handover point, made explicit and placeable: drop it
  wherever the band should retire and the band retires there. It renders nothing
  visible — its only job is to be a position in the flow.

  Desktop ignores it; the band is mobile-only.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div
  class="pdp-band-rest"
  data-band-rest
  aria-hidden="true"
  style="--band-rest-gap: {{ section.settings.gap | default: 0 }}px;"
></div>

<style>
  /* Zero-height by default so it cannot introduce a seam between the sections
     it sits between. The gap setting exists for when the band's disappearance
     needs a beat of breathing room instead. */
  .pdp-band-rest {
    height: var(--band-rest-gap, 0);
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Sticky ATC resting area",
  "class": "section-pdp-band-rest",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Invisible. Marks where the mobile add-to-cart band stops following the shopper — place it directly above the first full-bleed section."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap",
      "label": "Breathing room",
      "min": 0, "max": 120, "step": 4, "default": 0,
      "unit": "px"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Sticky ATC resting area" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
